        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">bravais lattice (3D)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The bravais lattice is a categorical value specification that specifies value of the crystal structure quality. It describes the possible geometric arrangement of lattice points in a crystal. The present descriptor is limited to the 14 possible three-dimensional arrangements.</skos:definition>
